      "content": "thanks, that makes sense. the audit rights idea is good. just one more thing—regarding those \"hidden actors\" or people acting in bad faith... is there any way to write the contract to specifically address those types of sneaky, underhanded tactics? we just want to be sure we aren't leaving any loopholes for people to exploit the system.",
